    "contract": "Optional JPEG cache requires cache query. Actual scoped routes omit it. Each request creates a fresh Keyframe/WriteBuffer/OnceBuffer and attaches to receiver before capturing incoming data. Producer dial failure returns empty content rejected by Verdify; no new frame reaches client timeout15s and nonzero capture/Job status. Per-Job emptyDir prevents earlier-job file reuse. Frigate latest-frame preview fallback is not the served scoped route.",
